# Environments
.env
# Backups of it, which `.env` alone does not match. A `.env.bak-20261104`
# written before editing the file showed up as UNTRACKED rather than ignored,
# one `git add -A` away from committing the API key. `.env.example` stays
# tracked -- it holds no values.
.env.bak*
.env.*.bak
.env.local
.envrc
.venv
env/
venv/
ENV/
env.bak/
venv.bak/

